An item's fence is read once, whatever block it follows

````
- ![a](i)
  ^ cap
  ```
  b
 y
  ```
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <figure>
      <img src="i" alt="a">
      <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <pre><code>b
</code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>y
<code></code></p>
````

````
- > q
  ```
  b
 y
  ```
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
    <pre><code>b
</code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>y
<code></code></p>
````
